を吸われ過ぎ、目を閉じてぐったりしている表情。息が荒くなっている。\n\n○その他\n・際ど過ぎる場合は内容を変えても構いません（衣服の上から胸を吸われるなど）。\n\nぶしつけな内容ですが、ご検討よろしくお願いします……！", "nc": 42, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 499939, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "LamuQa（ﾗﾑｶ）@AF2026🩸", "screen_name": "LamuQa", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1761990906734063616/LSrqIlS0.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1099556023898009600/1771770637/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 160}, {"id": 717229, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "Ytori", "screen_name": "Ytori_3939", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2060958071795703808/WMA3yKFP.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1288501025368809472/1658986576/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 176}, {"id": 1157633, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "きんむぎマン", "screen_name": "KinmugiMan_sm", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1698291133804384256/fz61AU4v.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1213817733847977984/1692968643/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art